 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Elijah walked with Elisha by the river Jordan's side",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask me what you want, my son, before I cross the great divide",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Elisha said a double portion of your spirit let it be",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you see me when I'm taken, it will come to you, said he",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Swing low, chariot of fire",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Horses of fire, carry him higher",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Up in a whirlwind, gone in a flash",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Elijah went home and he never looked back",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As they walked along and talked, the sky began to burn",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A chariot came between them and there would be no return",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My father, oh my father, cried Elisha on the ground",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he picked up the mantle that came floating softly down",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
